{
  "tema": 6872,
  "slug": "habia-hubo",
  "titulo": "Había vs hubo: imperfect vs preterite of haber",
  "subtitulo": "Había un perro en el parque, hubo un choque en la carretera.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "There was / were: había (imperfect) describes a scene; hubo (preterite) reports a completed event. Both stay singular.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "There are two ways to say _there was / there were_ in Spanish:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Form",
            "Tense",
            "Use"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "había",
              "imperfect",
              "description: what was there, the scene"
            ],
            [
              "hubo",
              "preterite",
              "an event that happened, with a beginning and an end"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Which one you use depends on how you see it. **Hubo** presents it as a completed event; **había** describes what was going on at that moment."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Events like accidents, parties, meetings, storms, problems usually take **hubo**. Things and people that were just there usually take **había**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Both stay **singular**, even with plural nouns: **había muchas olas**, **hubo dos accidentes**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **había** is a photo; **hubo** is a news headline."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Había== un perro en el parque.",
              "en": "There was a dog in the park."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hubo== un choque en la carretera.",
              "en": "There was a crash on the highway."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hubo== buena música en la fiesta.",
              "en": "There was good music at the party."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Había== muchos clientes en la tienda.",
              "en": "There were lots of customers in the store."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hubo== mucha comida en la fiesta.",
              "en": "There was a lot of food at the party. (the event, as a whole)"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Había== mucha comida en la fiesta.",
              "en": "There was a lot of food at the party. (describing the scene)"
            },
            {
              "es": "Cuando llegué, ==había== olas enormes.",
              "en": "When I arrived, there were huge waves."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
